1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Enterprise Skill Platform moves enterprise AI from copied agents to governed, reusable capabilities.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Employees think in intents. Enterprise capabilities remain scattered. ESP bridges the gap.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:17,000
This public Demo uses synthetic data. A natural-language request enters one governed Review workspace.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:26,000
The Router understands intent, validates the Consumer Binding, and executes five pinned Skills through authorized Plugins.

5
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Every material claim resolves to retained Evidence. Decision Lineage preserves versions, citations, and the Correlation ID.

6
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:44,000
The model proposes risk. The accountable analyst changes the rating and creates Human Decision evidence.

7
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Policy denial stops the responsible Skill and Plugin. ESP does not bypass policy or invent a result.

8
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:04,000
The Governance Control Plane shows versions, Bindings, authorization, oversight, and the Pilot boundary.

9
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:14,000
Seven synthetic cases pass all 84 mandatory assertions. Synthetic evidence does not establish Pilot approval.

10
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Two Consumers resolve the same pinned Skill and Plugins with no copied implementation.

11
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:28,000
Build once. Govern once. Reuse everywhere.